@startuml
title IMRS - C4 Container View

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Doctor
actor "Hospital Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "IMRS" {
    component "Web Application\n[Container: Browser]" as Web
    component "Backend API\n[Container: Application Server]" as API
    database "PostgreSQL\n[Container: Relational Database]" as PostgreSQL
    database "Qdrant\n[Container: Vector Database]" as Qdrant
}

cloud "AI / LLM Service\n[External System]" as LLM

Doctor --> Web : Search clinical information
Admin --> Web : Manage system access
Web --> API : HTTPS / REST
API --> PostgreSQL : Read and write clinical data
API --> Qdrant : Search clinical vectors
API --> LLM : Generate a grounded answer
API --> Web : Answer and status

@enduml
